{"id":570,"date":"2020-01-02T18:39:21","date_gmt":"2020-01-02T17:39:21","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/strasbourgcarrelage.com\/?page_id=570"},"modified":"2020-03-31T16:31:32","modified_gmt":"2020-03-31T14:31:32","slug":"style-scandinave","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/styles\/style-scandinave\/","title":{"rendered":"Style scandinave"},"content":{"rendered":"<section id=\"title-two-columns-block_5e0dfebb2d33c\" class=\"title-two-columns-block\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        \n        <div class=\"text\">\n            <p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strasbourg Carrelage vous propose d\u2019adopter une d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure<\/span><b> conviviale<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et <\/span><b>raffin\u00e9e <\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">avec le carrelage style scandinave.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">G\u00e9n\u00e9ralement compos\u00e9e de<\/span><b> mat\u00e9riaux bruts<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, le style de d\u00e9coration nordique donnera un aspect <\/span><b>accueillant<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u00e0 votre d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Le carrelage style scandinave peut aussi bien habiller les sols d\u2019une cuisine, que ceux d\u2019un salon ou encore d\u2019une chambre.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">De plus le style de d\u00e9co su\u00e9dois s\u2019accompagne g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement de <\/span><b>meubles \u00e9pur\u00e9s<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, souvent en bois, ainsi que de <\/span><b>multiples point de lumi\u00e8res<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> diff\u00e9rents au sein d\u2019une m\u00eame pi\u00e8ce. Les influences su\u00e9doises comprennent aussi des objets de d\u00e9coration tels que des <\/span><b>paniers en osier<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> ou des <\/span><b>seaux en suspension.<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Cela permet d\u2019\u00e9gayer vos pi\u00e8ces avec des plantes et des fleurs.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Enfin, les types de carrelage qui s\u2019adaptent le mieux au style scandinave sont les carrelages <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/imitations\/imitation-bois\/\"><b>imitation bois<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/imitations\/imitation-beton\/\"><b>imitation b\u00e9ton<\/b><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Strasbourg Carrelage <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">a install\u00e9 plus d\u2019un million de m\u00e8tres carr\u00e9s de carrelage en Alsace. Nous sommes une entreprise familiale qui vous accompagne <\/span><b>depuis plus de 17 ans<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> dans vos projets de d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure en Alsace<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Nous proposons de nombreuses marques prestigieuses de carrelage dans notre showroom de Strasbourg, dans le Bas-Rhin.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Notre priorit\u00e9 est de vous aider \u00e0 r\u00e9aliser vos projets de d\u00e9coration int\u00e9rieure style scandinave, et cela gr\u00e2ce \u00e0 notre capacit\u00e9 \u00e0 comprendre vos <\/span><b>envies<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> et de vos <\/span><b>besoins<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n<section id=\"red-content-block_5e0dff882d33d\" class=\"red-content-block simple\" style=\"background-color: #8b0936\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n            \n                            <h3 class=\"big-title\"><span><p>Int\u00e9ress\u00e9(e) par l\u2019un de ces mod\u00e8les ?<\/p>\n<\/span><\/h3>\n            \n                            <div class=\"text\">\n                    <p>Vous recherchez un style particulier ? Vous souhaitez voir d\u2019autres carrelages de ce genre ?<br \/>\nContactez-nous, nous vous proposerons d\u2019autres produits, au meilleur prix !<\/p>\n\n                <\/div>\n            \n            \n                                                <p class=\"text-center\">\n                                        <a class=\"btn btn-outline-white\" href=\"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/contact\/\" title=\"Contactez-nous\">Contactez-nous<\/a>\n                            \n                    <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n<\/section>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>D\u00e9couvrez notre collection carrelage style scandinave, pour donner un aspect design et chaleureux \u00e0 votre int\u00e9rieur, tout en b\u00e9n\u00e9ficiant des avantages qu\u2019offre le carrelage.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":362,"parent":216,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-570","page","type-page","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/570","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=570"}],"version-history":[{"count":14,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/570\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":998,"href":"https:\/\/www.strasbourgcarrelage.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/570\/revisions\/998"}],"up":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/w